mber of days in a week**: There are 7 days in a week.\n\n2. **Calculate the number of complete weeks in 200 days**:\n   \\[\n   200 \\div 7 = 28 \\text{ weeks and } 4 \\text{ days remainder}\n   \\]\n   This means 200 days is equivalent to 28 full weeks plus 4 extra days.\n\n3. **Determine the day of the week 4 days before today (Wednesday)**:\n   - 1 day before Wednesday is Tuesday.\n   - 2 days before Wednesday is Monday.\n   - 3 days before Wednesday is Sunday.\n   - 4 days before Wednesday is Saturday.\n\nTherefore, Kim's birthday fell on a \\boxed{Saturday}."},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{Saturday}","correct":true,"format":"boxed","parseable":true}}
